            <description><![CDATA[<h2>ScreenTake 0.1.20</h2>
<ul>
<li>Add styled text overlays and separate video, camera, audio, zoom, and text timeline tracks.</li>
<li>Remove the camera background in live preview and exported video.</li>
<li>Adjust recorded audio independently, control gap closing, and clean up silence in added audio tracks.</li>
<li>Use the updated bundled MCP helper; reconnect your AI client after installing.</li>
</ul>
<p>Requires Apple Silicon and macOS 13 or later. Save your project before updating.</p>
]]></description>
